{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "traffic-spike",
  "title": "A traffic spike",
  "summary": "Average load looks fine, but a short burst overwhelms the server. See why capacity planning is about peaks, not averages.",
  "level": "beginner",
  "minutes": 3,
  "project": {
    "name": "A traffic spike",
    "serverProfile": {
      "os": "linux",
      "cpuCores": 4,
      "cpuGhz": 3.0,
      "ramGb": 16.0,
      "disk": {
        "kind": "ssd",
        "iops": 20000
      },
      "network": {
        "bandwidthMbps": 1000.0,
        "latencyMs": 0.5
      },
      "virtualization": "vm",
      "fdLimit": 65536
    },
    "trafficProfile": {
      "concurrentUsers": 1000,
      "requestsPerSecond": 200.0,
      "readRatio": 0.8,
      "spike": {
        "kind": "none"
      }
    },
    "topology": {
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "client",
          "kind": "client",
          "label": "Users",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 120
          },
          "template": null,
          "settings": {},
          "replicas": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "app",
          "kind": "appServer",
          "label": "Everything on one machine",
          "position": {
            "x": 280,
            "y": 120
          },
          "template": null,
          "settings": {},
          "replicas": 1
        }
      ],
      "edges": [
        {
          "id": "e-client-app",
          "source": "client",
          "target": "app"
        }
      ]
    },
    "chaos": {
      "faults": [],
      "policy": {
        "timeoutMs": 10000.0,
        "maxRetries": 0,
        "backoffMs": 100.0
      }
    },
    "slo": {
      "p95Ms": 200.0,
      "maxErrorRate": 0.01
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Steady traffic",
      "narration": [
        "200 requests per second is comfortable for this server: about half of what it can do.",
        "Average load is what most dashboards show first, and here it says everything is fine."
      ],
      "highlight": ["app"],
      "changes": [],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 60.0,
        "speed": 8
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "A spike arrives",
      "narration": [
        "Every minute, traffic triples for fifteen seconds, perhaps because of a newsletter or a scheduled job. The average barely moves, but the peak is 600 requests per second.",
        "During the spike the server falls behind. The queue fills, latency soars and some requests are rejected, and it takes a while to drain afterwards."
      ],
      "highlight": ["app"],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "setTraffic",
          "traffic": {
            "concurrentUsers": 1000,
            "requestsPerSecond": 200.0,
            "readRatio": 0.8,
            "spike": {
              "kind": "periodic",
              "periodS": 60.0,
              "multiplier": 3.0,
              "durationS": 15.0
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 60.0,
        "speed": 8
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": "app"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Headroom absorbs it",
      "narration": [
        "Run two copies of the server. The spike now lands on twice the capacity and passes almost unnoticed.",
        "The price is a lot of idle capacity most of the time, which is why teams argue about how much headroom is enough."
      ],
      "highlight": ["app"],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "apply",
          "change": {
            "kind": "replicas",
            "node": "app",
            "count": 2
          }
        }
      ],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 60.0,
        "speed": 8
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "utilizationBelow",
          "node": "app",
          "value": 0.5
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
